flowchart TB
  START([VPN suite start]) --> PRE[Preflight ATT + hub alive]
  PRE --> VB{Variant B eth WAN}
  VB -->|primary| ETH[DUT eth0 to lab LAN<br/>reach hexa-five .16]
  ETH --> RUNB[Run WG + OVPN cases]
  RUNB --> VA{Variant A cellular}
  VA -->|optional after CEL PASS| CEL[DUT wwan0 default route<br/>still reach hub public/VPN endpoint]
  CEL --> RUNA[Re-run connect / reconnect]
  RUNA --> DUAL[Dual-client concurrent<br/>rpi-4b + rpi-5]
  DUAL --> DONE([Archive evidence on molt])
  VA -->|no SIM / CEL SKIP| SKIPA[SKIP Variant A]
  SKIPA --> DUAL
